          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "margin-bottom:18px;"
              },
              "html": "<strong>Choose Bonded if</strong> you mainly want to plan a scene in writing: talk through what you want, get explicit ideas, ask specific questions.<br><strong>Choose Caresse if</strong> you also want to be guided during: a voice that carries the session from start to finish, with nobody having to reply or hold the phone."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>Bonded</strong> works as an AI chat specialised in kinky eroticism: Aria takes your toys and your relationship dynamic into account, assigns roles and suggests explicit scenes. That works well for planning. The problem appears when it's time to act: every step waits for your written reply before delivering the next. <strong>Caresse</strong> covers both moments. Beforehand, you set up your profile: first names, genders, practices, intensity, mood. Then the session starts and plays on its own with a duration that varies with generation. Nothing left to read, type or confirm: you are both simply in the moment."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
